OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCLowkey acknowledgement of BBC
OL,4,CTV 90th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ninetieth anniversary of BBC
OL,7,FTelevision is being marked quietly.
OL,9,FPerhaps this is no surprise given the
OL,10,Fcorporation's current problems.
OL,12,FThe celebrations are limited to a few
OL,13,Farchive programmes on BBC Four.
OL,15,FBut it's worth turning the clock back
OL,16,Fto the corporation's magnificent
OL,17,Fcelebrations to mark BBC TV's 50th
OL,18,Fanniversary in 1986.
OL,20,FThey came a week after a significant
OL,21,Fdevelopment in BBC TV's history ` the
OL,22,Flaunch of a full daytime service.
OL,23,APub: 01-Nov-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12102
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1793564794
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCLowkey acknowledgement of BBC
OL,4,CTV 90th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe start of daytime hardly ranks along
OL,7,Fwith the launch of BBC Two, colour and
OL,8,FBreakfast Time or any of the truly rare
OL,9,Fbut magnificent programmes which earned
OL,10,FBBC TV its reputation.
OL,12,FBut it did address a significant
OL,13,Fweakness in the schedule. By 1986 the
OL,14,Ffact that a flagship channel could be
OL,15,Fclosed as late as 3.50pm in the
OL,16,Fafternoon was truly lamentable.
OL,18,FI actually wonder if the launch of
OL,19,Fdaytime should have been delayed for a
OL,20,Fweek so it was part of the celebrations
OL,21,F` BBC TV, a service with a proud past
OL,22,Fand confident future.
OL,23,APub: 01-Nov-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12103
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1793564794
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCLowkey acknowledgement of BBC
OL,4,CTV 90th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FA brilliant Radio Times cover showing a
OL,7,F1930s family watching the Nine o'Clock
OL,8,FNews on a modern TV caught the mood
OL,9,Fperfectly.
OL,11,FAs for the celebrations themselves,
OL,12,Fthey were a treat for viewers.
OL,14,FSaturday night on BBC One featured a
OL,15,Fgala celebration. There was even a
OL,16,Flittle interval film to mark the break
OL,17,Ffor the news.
OL,19,FThen all through the week, BBC Two's
OL,20,Fevening schedule was devoted to the
OL,21,Farchives.
OL,23,APub: 01-Nov-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12104
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1793564794
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCLowkey acknowledgement of BBC
OL,4,CTV 90th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere were rare individual programmes
OL,7,Fof distinction in all fields:
OL,8,Fstandalone episodes of groundbreaking
OL,9,Fseries like Z Cars, plays,
OL,10,Fdocumentaries, arts programmes,
OL,11,FCrackerjack and Bruce Forsyth and the
OL,12,FGeneration Game. Late Night Line-Up
OL,13,Freturned for the week.
OL,15,FPresentation, naturally, added to the
OL,16,Fcelebrations.
OL,18,FFamous in-vision announcers returned
OL,19,Ffor the week to BBC Two to share the
OL,20,Fevening junctions with the normal
OL,21,Fout-of-vision team.
OL,23,APub: 01-Nov-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12105
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1793564794
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCLowkey acknowledgement of BBC
OL,4,CTV 90th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere was also a lovely coincidence on
OL,7,FSunday morning ` or was it planned?
OL,9,FPages from Ceefax on BBC Two on Sunday
OL,10,Fmorning gave way to the test card ` as
OL,11,Fwas not uncommon if the Ceefax
OL,12,Fgenerator/transmission system was
OL,13,Fplaying up.
OL,15,FAt the time the trade test tape which
OL,16,Fbegan with a Bach prelude and fugue was
OL,17,Fplaying ` this was an old tape which
OL,18,Fwas often brought out of the cupboard
OL,19,Fon Sundays and special occasions.
OL,21,FCoincidences happen but this sounds
OL,22,Fsuspicious.
OL,23,APub: 01-Nov-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12106
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1793564794
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCLowkey acknowledgement of BBC
OL,4,CTV 90th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC in 1986 was under fire from a
OL,7,Fhostile government which accused it of
OL,8,Fleft wing bias. There were people on
OL,9,Fthe libertarian right who wanted the
OL,10,Fcorporation to be privatised or take
OL,11,Fadverts.
OL,13,FTV50 ` without saying so explicitly `
OL,14,Freminded the public of how much poorer
OL,15,Fwe would all be without BBC Television.
OL,17,FThere were more bad headlines for the
OL,18,FBBC in the following weeks.
OL,23,APub: 01-Nov-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12107
SC,0007
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1793564794
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCLowkey acknowledgement of BBC
OL,4,CTV 90th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tragedy of the death of Michael
OL,7,FLush while rehearsing for The Late,
OL,8,FLate Breakfast Show remains one of the
OL,9,Fworst moments in the corporation's
OL,10,Fhistory.
OL,12,FThe thought that someone should die in
OL,13,Fa terrible accident while taking part
OL,14,Fin a rehearsal for a light
OL,15,Fentertainment show ` leaving a grieving
OL,16,Ffamily and friends ` still remains hard
OL,17,Fto comprehend.
OL,23,APub: 01-Nov-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12108
SC,0008
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1793564794
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCLowkey acknowledgement of BBC
OL,4,CTV 90th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is hard to truly forgive those whose
OL,7,Factions unintentionally brought this
OL,8,Fabout. In any context, programme-makers
OL,9,Fowe an enormous duty of care to
OL,10,Fparticipants.
OL,12,FAs an aside, it could easily have cost
OL,13,FNoel Edmonds his career even though he
OL,14,Fwas blameless.
OL,16,FWe could have been denied Telly Addicts
OL,17,For the glorious stupidity of the first
OL,18,Ffew years of Noel's House Party. We are
OL,19,Flucky Noel's career could resume.
OL,23,APub: 01-Nov-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12109
SC,0009
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1793564794
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G9/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCLowkey acknowledgement of BBC
OL,4,CTV 90th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeparately, concerns about some of the
OL,7,FBBC's journalism led to the firing of
OL,8,Fthe Director-General Alasdair Milne in
OL,9,Fearly 1987.
OL,11,FBut for one week in 1986, an under
OL,12,Fsiege corporation staged an
OL,13,Funapologetic celebration to remind
OL,14,Fthose who loved the BBC of why they
OL,15,Floved it.
OL,17,FIt really needs to do something like
OL,18,Fthis again now.
OL,23,APub: 01-Nov-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
